{"version":1,"content":"<p>天氣漸涼，又到衣物換季的時節。</p><p>想要輕鬆應對，不妨參考網上流傳的處理方法：先檢視、取出冬季衣物，再妥善清潔與封存夏裝，最後重新整理衣櫃，令日常穿搭與家居收納事半功倍。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;-------------------&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.726354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:00:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.715710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.715710+00:00","content_hash":"98c6885b813ac18d5a9e245ea6eccb0de9f82442f04374303418851f05aab8fe","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}